# Wave T40 (Clover kit): sapling (prop) — a young two-leaf sapling: thin trunk, two leaf clusters (the town's two-leaf motif; the painting's two kids planning in the street), a timber guard ring at its base. A pair flanks the Center's frontage on the south lawn. Fully opaque, town grass baked in (measured engine tg #178913). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T40-CLOVER-PLAN.md §5.)
